{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月4日，針對「巴菲特48年沒喝過水」的相關消息，與巴菲特有過多次當面交流的段永平表示自己「也有點不太相信」，但又稱「見過巴菲特很多次，記憶當中確實沒見過巴菲特喝水。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585010.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.681752+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:42:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.677513+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:23.677513+00:00","content_hash":"952e74ee24e1d7a43dd9f9ef3f06034676f2a6faaa4ce3e474c1ad5b57ab86e4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}